`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
- `defaults` only fills a value if nothing has set it yet. The root `use` always runs before a branch `use`. So if the root still set `rounds: 10`, a `/dialogue` default of 4 would never take effect. That's why `rounds` moved off the root and onto each branch.
